        "comments": "For Illumina DNA sequencing (HiSeq 2000), seven paired-end sequencing libraries were constructed with insert sizes of about 170bp, 500 bp, 800bp, 2 kb, 5 kb, 10 kb and 20kb, and the raw data was about 127.17G (98X).After correcting the short insert size data and removing the small peak of the large insert size data, we got about 81.56G (62.74X) high quality data. Then we begin to assemble with SOAPdenovo (version2.0). The Columba livia assembly version 1.0 has a sequencing depth of 60X and more than 87% of the assembly has 20-fold raw sequence coverage.",
